# This repository intentionally contains only the two downstream source packages.
*
!.gitignore
!README.md
!downstream-analysis/
!downstream-analysis/**
!downstream-studio/
!downstream-studio/**

# Local environments, caches, and generated development state
**/.DS_Store
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.venv/
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/build/
**/*.egg-info/

# Never version credentials, local databases, datasets, or experiment outputs
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/*.sqlite
**/*.sqlite3
**/results/
**/runs/
**/uploads/
**/trash/
